// Kaileron managed arcade profile.
//
// Bootstrapped from HBMAME's hbmame.lst, then maintained as a committed
// source filter.  Do not regenerate this file during normal builds.
//
// HBMAME-only driver files are intentionally skipped; this filter keeps
// the bundle on official MAME sources while reusing HBMAME's compact
// arcade-oriented source selection.
// Some skipped HBMAME split sources are covered by official aggregate sources
// such as neogeo/neogeo.cpp and pacman/pacman.cpp.

